      {
       "text": "探测光的电极化率为$\\kchione = \\frac{N}{\\kV}\\frac{|\\kmu|^2}{\\hbar\\epsilon_0}\\frac{\\krhothreeone}{\\kOmegaone}$，即$N/\\kV$个原子在单位场下的极化强度。",
